  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "反胃想吐的感覺。[例]惡心",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5729",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.不良善的、壞的。與「善」相對。[例]邪惡、惡毒、面善心惡\n2.罪過、不良的行為。[例]作惡多端、隱惡揚善\n3.粗劣的。[例]惡衣惡食\n4.醜陋。[例]醜惡",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5737",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.如何、怎麼。[例]棄父之命，惡用子矣！（《左傳．桓公十六年》）\n2.嘆詞。表示驚訝的語氣。[例]惡！是何言也！（《孟子．公孫丑下》）",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "6231",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.憎恨、討厭。[例]嫌惡、憎惡、厭惡\n2.羞恥、恥辱。[例]羞惡之心",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "6271",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  ]
}
